This directory is generated from `packs/cyberpunk-tv-platform/ontology/platform.ttl`.

## Runtime

- **UNRDF** owns the canonical semantic world.
- **Mermaid/mmdio** renders structural and procedural views.
- **deck.gl** renders spatial and temporal views.
- **ggen** manufactures the runtime from the admitted graph.

## Replay

```bash
npm install
npm run build
npm run verify
```

The verifier recomputes BLAKE3 digests over the manufactured runtime and emits a deterministic receipt under `.ggen/receipts/`.
